{#-
    INTERFACE (stable, shared by every leaderboard - docs/features/xp-levels/ux-polish/design-spec.md §4, value option 4A):
    The value cell's content: the board's coloured bold number + one small muted secondary line. Boards are told apart only
    by this column. Put it inside <td class="lb-time">.
      {{ include('leaderboards/_value.html.twig', {value: '2,140 XP', secondary: 'Lv 34', family: 'level'}) }}
    family: level (indigo) · achievements (amber) · karma (rose) · competition (teal) · ink (times, unchanged); secondary optional
    value_prefix (optional, rendered HTML): a small mark before the number, the number stays on the right edge - the MSP
    Rating's points change "(−1) 996"
-#}
<span class="lb-value lb-value-{{ family|default('ink') }}">
    <span class="lb-value-number">{% if value_prefix|default('')|trim is not same as('') %}{{ value_prefix|raw }} {% endif %}{{ value }}</span>
    {%- if secondary|default(null) is not null and secondary is not same as('') %}
        <span class="lb-value-secondary">{{ secondary }}</span>
    {%- endif %}
</span>
